      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "text": "1. Continuously ingest individual video view events from a Kafka stream\n2. Serve precise top K (K <= 1000) videos for all-time\n3. Serve precise top K videos for tumbling windows of 1 hour, 1 day, and 1\nmonth",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Continuously ingest individual video view events from a Kafka stream\n2. Serve precise top K (K <= 1000) videos for all-time\n3. Serve precise top K videos for tumbling windows of 1 hour, 1 day, and 1\nmonth",
